A||||4||fiero56||Ebay buying safety||||1||
Z||000000||fiero56||12-16-2000||09:16 PM||||I have my eye on a certain stereo headunit for my Formula and found an ebay retailer selling the same for $100 less. I am just wondering how safe I should feel spending over $200 over ebay. Since the retailer accepts credit cards that makes me feel better. But how do I know I'm not just giving some stranger my c/c info for use at their leisure. <BR>How safe shuold I feel? I've bought stuff off ebay before, but never more than $40.<P>Here is the "auction" to let you know what I'm dealing with: <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=1202220965" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=1202220965</A> <P>Should I feel safe doing this?<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 12-16-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||12-16-2000||09:42 PM||||I just looked at this guys feedback rating. He looks like a darn good retailer to me. I would have to say that your risk is minimal. You can go into his feedback file and email a few of his past customers for reference. I'm sure that they wouldn't leave such glowing feedback for a slug though. Just my opinion. And Happy Bidding...lol||||reg||6
Z||000002||Black88GT||12-17-2000||12:29 AM||||Use Paypal.  Ebay purchases are already insured, because you need a credit card to sell, therefore if you don't ship then ebay will refund you the money then charge their card.  If they have a positive rating over 100 or 500 or something high like that, I wouldn't worry at all. <P> <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||12-17-2000||03:29 PM||||Also, Your CC # will not be posted to the person selling it. Just to Paypal. I have used Paypal and have not had any problems buying or selling.||||reg||1
Z||000004||FieroJoe||12-18-2000||09:11 PM||||I think that paypal is great.  I've used it not only on ebay, but just with buying things from individual people too.  Never had any discrepancy on my visa statement either, really great service!<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
